+
+There are no submitted `[total]`, `[functional]`, `[simplification]`,
+`[concrete]`, explicit priority, or opaque declarations. `[owise]` supplies
+the usual lower priority to R14. Imported theory is `STRING-SYNTAX`, `INT`,
